<title>FRANCE: Groupe Paribas H1 net attrib 4.04 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Groupe Paribas H1 net attrib 4.04 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   4,042  vs	     609</p>
<p>    Net					    5,498  vs	   1,556</p>
<p>    Gross operating			    8,533  vs	   4,498</p>
<p>    Global operating income		 19,855  vs	  14,657</p>
<p>    Operating costs			   11,322  vs	  10,169</p>
<p>    Net banking income			14,717  vs	  13,259</p>
<p>    Provisions				   1,832  vs	   1,905</p>
<p>NOTE - Groupe Paribas said in a statement its Cooke ratio was 8.7 percent versus 8.9 percent at December 31 and the core ratio 8.1 percent versus 7.9 percent.</p>
<p>The group said its net assets stood at 52.1 billion francs, up 1.8 percent on December 31. Net assets per share is estimated at 474 francs versus 438 francs at end-December, it added.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
